{"id": "438041", "name": "אורך גרף של ln(x²−1)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "f", "params": ["x"], "body": "log(x^2-1)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>חשבו את אורך הגרף של הפונקציה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(x)={{CT:0}} \\]</p><p>מעל הקטע <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([{{CT:1}},{{CT:2}}]\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>רשמו את הערך המדויק (לא קירוב עשרוני). אפשר להשתמש ב-<code>ln</code>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(L\\) = [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מחשבים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1+f'(x)^2\\)</span> ומגלים שזה ריבוע שלם; את האינטגרנד מפרקים לשברים חלקיים.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — האינטגרנד</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f'(x)=\\frac{2x}{x^2-1},\\qquad 1+f'(x)^2=\\frac{(x^2-1)^2+4x^2}{(x^2-1)^2}=\\frac{(x^2+1)^2}{(x^2-1)^2} \\]</p>בקטע <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x>1\\)</span> המכנה חיובי, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\sqrt{1+f'(x)^2}=\\frac{x^2+1}{x^2-1}=1+\\frac{2}{x^2-1}=1+\\frac{1}{x-1}-\\frac{1}{x+1} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — אורך הגרף</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ L=\\Big[x+\\ln(x-1)-\\ln(x+1)\\Big]_{ {{CT:1}} }^{ {{CT:2}} }={{CT:3}}+\\ln\\frac{ {{CT:4}} }{ {{CT:5}} }-\\ln\\frac{ {{CT:6}} }{ {{CT:7}} }={{CT:8}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "<p>Correct answer, well done.</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p>Your answer is partially correct.</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p>Incorrect answer.</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "tans1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "b-a-log((b-1)*(a+1)/((b+1)*(a-1)))", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<p>בדקו את הסימנים בפירוק לשברים חלקיים: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{2}{x^2-1}=\\frac{1}{x-1}-\\frac{1}{x+1}\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "log((b-1)*(a+1)/((b+1)*(a-1)))", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<p>שכחתם את ה-1: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{x^2+1}{x^2-1}=1+\\frac{2}{x^2-1}\\)</span>, ולכן באורך יש גם את המחובר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(b-a\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "am", "b", "bm", "tans1"], "nvariants": 24}